      "representative_posted_date": "2026-06-02T04:00Z",
      "representative_length": 358,
      "representative_excerpt": "I value independent science, medical research, public health, food safety, vaccines, maternal health, climate science and the basic principle that evidence should come before political ideology. It is imperative for the longevity of the US that reviews of awards of federal financial assistance be conducted by qualified professionals without political bias.",
