      "representative_excerpt": "The new rules make peer review a mere secondary consideration and would allow any federal agency to cancel any grant at any time based on the vague assertion that it isn't \"in the national interest.\" This new rule will completely disrupt how scientists are able to attend conferences. Typically, scientists submit grant proposals with line items budgeted for...",
