      "representative_excerpt": "These changes enable politicians to dictate which studies are funded, rather than the rigorous peer review process that allows other scientists to judge whether or not a study was done well enough to warrant further funding. It also allows politicians on all sides to deny funding for research that doesn't fit their political narratives, no matter how true...",
